WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.915
Read a clock

2
00:00:01.915 --> 00:00:30.638
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Read a clock. Clock par chhoti sui hour aur lambi sui minutes dikhati hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:30.638 --> 00:01:04.468
3:30 par lambi sui 6 par hoti hai aur chhoti sui 3 aur 4 ke beech. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:04.468 --> 00:01:40.851
Apne din ke teen kaam note karo; start aur finish time ke beech minutes gino. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
00:01:40.851 --> 00:02:55.532
Ab practice karo: Ek ghante mein kitne minutes? Thoda rukkar socho. Sahi jawab hai 60. Baaki options kyun fit nahi hote, yeh bhi apne shabdon mein batao. Clock par chhoti sui hour aur lambi sui minutes dikhati hai. 3:30 par lambi sui 6 par hoti hai aur chhoti sui 3 aur 4 ke beech. Is idea ko yaad rakhne ke liye apni notebook mein ek chhota labelled drawing banao. Jab tum apne shabdon mein samjha paate ho, tab tumne sirf answer nahi yaad kiya, balki uska reason bhi samjha. Aaj ka chhota recap: Clock par chhoti sui hour aur lambi sui minutes dikhati hai. Agli baar aas-paas ki duniya mein isi idea ka ek aur example dhoondhna.

